; CABALLERITO UI tiles (ui-designer). BG/window tiles, black on white.
; Groups: HUD (resident during INTRO/PLAY), SCREEN (title/clear/gameover only),
; LOGO_00.. (title only, consecutive run, cut from a bitmap by the ui-designer).
; Keep the order: code may rely on consecutive runs (FRAME_*, LOGO_*).

; ---------------- HUD group (indices 0-4, always resident)
; white; space/sky in every UI screen
@ BLANK
........
........
........
........
........
........
........
........
; HUD coin (gold coin, vertical slot)
@ ICON_COIN
..####..
.#----#.
#--#+--#
#--#+--#
#--#+--#
#--#+--#
.#----#.
..####..
; HUD lives: Teo's head facing right, feather on top
@ ICON_HEAD
##......
#-####..
.#++++#.
#++...#.
#+..#..#
#+....#.
.#...#..
..###...
; HUD time: hourglass
@ ICON_TIME
#######.
.#...#..
..#-#...
...#....
..#.#...
.#.+.#..
.#+++#..
#######.
; multiplication sign, sits on the font baseline (row 6)
@ ICON_TIMES
